- `services/graph/models.jac` — Define enums EventType {MAINTENANCE, PAYMENT, LEASE, COMPLAINT, INQUIRY} and UrgencyLevel {LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, CRITICAL} with sem descriptions per member. Nodes with defaulted fields: Property(name, address, city, state, zip_code: str=""); Unit(number:str="", bedrooms:int=1, bathrooms:int=1, sq_ft:int=0, status:str="occupied"); Lease(start_date, end_date: str="", rent_amount:float=0.0, deposit:float=0.0, status:str="active"); Tenant(name, phone, email: str="", payment_status:str="current", move_in_date:str=""); Ticket(ticket_id, category, description: str="", urgency:str="medium", status:str="open", ai_summary, ai_diagnosis, recommended_action, tenant_reply, owner_alert, created_at, resolved_at, vendor_name: str="", estimated_cost:float=0.0); Vendor(name, category, phone, email: str="", rating:float=0.0, avg_cost:float=0.0, available:bool=True). Edges HasUnit, HasLease, HasTenant, HasTicket, AssignedTo (no fields) and Services(jobs_completed:int=0, total_spent:float=0.0, last_service_date:str=""). Graph shape: root -> Property -HasUnit-> Unit -HasLease-> Lease -HasTenant-> Tenant; Unit -HasTicket-> Ticket; Property -Services-> Vendor. Public interface: `EventType`, `UrgencyLevel`, `Property`, `Unit`, `Lease`, `Tenant`, `Ticket`, `Vendor`, `HasUnit`, `HasLease`, `HasTenant`, `HasTicket`, `Services`, `AssignedTo`.
- `services/graph/localdb.jac` — Local SQLite log store using Python stdlib only (os getcwd, os.path join, sqlite3 connect, json dumps/loads, datetime). glob _db_path = <cwd>/.jac/data/app.db and glob _tables_ready flag; private _ensure_tables() creates sms_messages, walker_logs and notifications tables once. Public helpers insert and query those tables, plus a generic db_insert/db_find keyed by collection; each catches exceptions and returns a failure dict or empty list. check_db_health() ensures tables and returns {ok:True, backend:"sqlite", path, tables:[names]} or {ok:False, backend:"sqlite", path} on error. Public interface: `log_sms`, `get_sms_history`, `log_walker_run`, `create_notification`, `get_notifications`, `db_insert`, `db_find`, `check_db_health`.
