ame, property_name, unit} for the first tenant with that phone, else on Root exit {matched:False}. Public interface: `list_properties`, `list_units`, `list_tickets`, `list_vendors`, `register_tenant`, `db_health`, `list_tenants`, `add_property_node`, `delete_tenant_node`, `delete_property_node`, `match_tenant`.
